 Module "module_radiation_clouds"
  (inc)(line-no.)(nest)(optimize)
               1                     !CWB2016
               2                     !ocl nosimd
               3                     !!!!!              module_radiation_clouds description             !!!!!
               4                     !!!!!  ==========================================================  !!!!!
               5                     !                                                                      !
               6                     !    the 'radiation_clouds.f' contains:                                !
               7                     !                                                                      !
               8                     !       'module_radiation_clouds' ---  compute cloud related quantities!
               9                     !                for radiation computations                            !
              10                     !                                                                      !
              11                     !    the following are the externally accessable subroutines:          !
              12                     !                                                                      !
              13                     !       'cld_init'           --- initialization routine                !
              14                     !          inputs:                                                     !
              15                     !           ( si, nlay, me, myrank )                                   !
              16                     !          outputs:                                                    !
              17                     !           ( none )                                                   !
              18                     !                                                                      !
              19                     !       'progcld1'           --- zhao/moorthi prognostic cloud scheme  !
              20                     !          inputs:                                                     !
              21                     !           (plyr,plvl,tlyr,tvly,qlyr,qstl,rhly,clw,                   !
              22                     !            xlat,xlon,slmsk,                                          !
              23                     !            ix, nlay, nlp1,                                           !
              24                     !          outputs:                                                    !
              25                     !            clouds,clds,mtop,mbot)                                    !
              26                     !                                                                      !
              27                     !       'progcld2'           --- ferrier prognostic cloud microphysics !
              28                     !          inputs:                                                     !
              29                     !           (plyr,plvl,tlyr,tvly,qlyr,qstl,rhly,clw,                   !
              30                     !            xlat,xlon,slmsk, f_ice,f_rain,r_rime,flgmin,              !
              31                     !            ix, nlay, nlp1,                                           !
              32                     !          outputs:                                                    !
              33                     !            clouds,clds,mtop,mbot)                                    !
              34                     !       'progcld3'           --- zhao/moorthi prognostic cloud + pdfcld!
              35                     !          inputs:                                                     !
              36                     !           (plyr,plvl,tlyr,tvly,qlyr,qstl,rhly,clw, cnvw,cnvc,        !
              37                     !            xlat,xlon,slmsk,                                          !
              38                     !            ix, nlay, nlp1,                                           !
              39                     !            deltaq,sup,kdt,me,                                        !
              40                     !          outputs:                                                    !
              41                     !            clouds,clds,mtop,mbot)                                    !
              42                     !                                                                      !
              43                     !       'diagcld1'           --- diagnostic cloud calc routine         !
              44                     !          inputs:                                                     !
              45                     !           (plyr,plvl,tlyr,rhly,vvel,cv,cvt,cvb,                      !
              46                     !            xlat,xlon,slmsk,                                          !
              47                     !            ix, nlay, nlp1,                                           !
              48                     !          outputs:                                                    !
              49                     !            clouds,clds,mtop,mbot)                                    !
              50                     !                                                                      !
              51                     !    internal accessable only subroutines:                             !
              52                     !       'gethml'             --- get diagnostic hi, mid, low clouds    !
              53                     !                                                                      !
              54                     !       'rhtable'            --- rh lookup table for diag cloud scheme !
              55                     !                                                                      !
              56                     !                                                                      !
              57                     !    cloud array description:                                          !
              58                     !                ---  for prognostic cloud: icldflg=1  ---             !
              59                     !          clouds(:,:,1)  -  layer total cloud fraction                !
              60                     !          clouds(:,:,2)  -  layer cloud liq water path                !
              61                     !          clouds(:,:,3)  -  mean effective radius for liquid cloud    !
              62                     !          clouds(:,:,4)  -  layer cloud ice water path                !
              63                     !          clouds(:,:,5)  -  mean effective radius for ice cloud       !
              64                     !          clouds(:,:,6)  -  layer rain drop water path                !
              65                     !          clouds(:,:,7)  -  mean effective radius for rain drop       !
              66                     !   **     clouds(:,:,8)  -  layer snow flake water path               !
              67                     !          clouds(:,:,9)  -  mean effective radius for snow flake      !
              68                     !   ** fu's scheme need to be normalized by snow density (g/m**3/1.0e6)!
              69                     !                ---  for diagnostic cloud: icldflg=0  ---             !
              70                     !          clouds(:,:,1)  -  layer total cloud fraction                !
              71                     !          clouds(:,:,2)  -  layer cloud optical depth                 !
              72                     !          clouds(:,:,3)  -  layer cloud single scattering albedo      !
              73                     !          clouds(:,:,4)  -  layer cloud asymmetry factor              !
              74                     !                                                                      !
              75                     !    external modules referenced:                                      !
              76                     !                                                                      !
              77                     !       'module physpara'            in 'physpara.f'                   !
              78                     !       'module physcons'            in 'physcons.f'                   !
              79                     !       'module module_microphysics' in 'module_bfmicrophysics.f'      !
              80                     !                                                                      !
              81                     !                                                                      !
              82                     ! program history log:                                                 !
              83                     !      nov 1992,   y.h., k.a.c, a.k. - cloud parameterization          !
              84                     !        'cldjms' patterned after slingo and slingo's work (jgr,       !
              85                     !        1992), stratiform clouds are allowed in any layer except      !
              86                     !        the surface and upper stratosphere. the relative humidity     !
              87                     !        criterion may cery in different model layers.                 !
              88                     !      mar 1993,   kenneth campana   - created original crhtab tables  !
              89                     !        for critical rh look up references.
              90                     !      feb 1994,   kenneth campana   - modified to use only one table  !
              91                     !        for all forecast hours.                                       !
              92                     !      oct 1995,   kenneth campana   - tuned cloud rh curves           !
              93                     !        rh-cld relation from tables created using mitchell-hahn       !
              94                     !        tuning technique on airforce rtneph observations.             !
              95                     !      nov 1995,   kenneth campana   - the bl relationships used       !
              96                     !        below llyr, except in marine stratus regions.                 !
              97                     !      apr 1996,   kenneth campana   - save bl cld amt in cld(,5)      !
              98                     !      aug 1997,   kenneth campana   - smooth out last bunch of bins   !
              99                     !        of the rh look up tables                                      !
             100                     !      dec 1998,   s. moorthi        - added prognostic cloud method   !
             101                     !      apr 2003,   yu-tai hou        - rewritten in frotran 90         !
             102                     !        modulized form 'module_rad_clouds' from combining the original!
             103                     !        subroutines 'cldjms', 'cldprp', and 'gcljms'. and seperated   !
             104                     !        prognostic and diagnostic methods into two packages.          !
             105                     !      --- 2003,   s. moorthi        - adapted b. ferrier's prognostic !
             106                     !        cloud scheme to ncep gfs model as additional option.          !
             107                     !      apr 2004,   yu-tai hou        - separated calculation of the    !
             108                     !        averaged h,m,l,bl cloud amounts from each of the cld schemes  !
             109                     !        to become an shared individule subprogram 'gethml'.           !
             110                     !      may 2004,   yu-tai hou        - rewritten ferrier's scheme as a !
             111                     !        separated program 'progcld2' in the cloud module.             !
             112                     !      apr 2005,   yu-tai hou        - modified cloud array and module !
             113                     !        structures.                                                   !
             114                     !      dec 2008,   yu-tai hou        - changed low-cld calculation,    !
             115                     !        now cantains clds from sfc layer and upward to the low/mid    !
             116                     !        boundary (include bl-cld). h,m,l clds domain boundaries are   !
             117                     !        adjusted for better agreement with observations.              !
             118                     !      jan 2011,   yu-tai hou        - changed virtual temperature     !
             119                     !        as input variable instead of originally computed inside the   !
             120                     !        two prognostic cld schemes 'progcld1' and 'progcld2'.         !
             121                     !      aug 2012,   yu-tai hou        - modified subroutine cld_init    !
             122                     !        to pass all fixed control variables at the start. and set     !
             123                     !        their correponding internal module variables to be used by    !
             124                     !        module subroutines.                                           !
             125                     !      nov 2012,   yu-tai hou        - modified control parameters     !
             126                     !        thru module 'physpara'.                                       !
             127                     !      apr 2013,   h.lin/y.hou       - corrected error in calculating  !
             128                     !        llyr for different vertical indexing directions.              !
             129                     !      jul 2013, r. sun/h. pan       - modified to use pdf cloud and   !
             130                     ! 	 convective cloud cover and water for radiation                !
             131                     !                                                                      !
             132                     !!!!!  ==========================================================  !!!!!
             133                     !!!!!                       end descriptions                       !!!!!
             134                     !!!!!  ==========================================================  !!!!!
             135                     
