            3658                     !
            3659                     !===> ... compute low, mid, high, total, and boundary layer cloud fractions
            3660                     !         and clouds top/bottom layer indices for low, mid, and high clouds.
            3661                     !         the three cloud domain boundaries are defined by ptopc.  the cloud
            3662                     !         overlapping method is defined by control flag 'iovr', which may
